@runtimeUrl = http://localhost:8097
@connectorUrl = http://localhost:8098

### Runtime health
GET {{runtimeUrl}}/actuator/health

### Connector health
GET {{connectorUrl}}/actuator/health

### Seed product in connector app
POST {{connectorUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-0001",
  "name": "Premium Wireless Headphones",
  "description": "Noise-cancelling over-ear headphones with 30h battery life.",
  "category": "Headphones",
  "tags": "wireless,noise-cancelling,audio",
  "price": 199.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "inStockQty": 25
}

### Direct connector contract call
POST {{connectorUrl}}/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "list_orders",
  "params": {
    "userId": "user-1"
  },
  "trace": {
    "requestId": "req-connector-1",
    "conversationId": "chat-connector-1",
    "userId": "user-1",
    "sessionId": "sess-1"
  }
}

### Runtime chat query using connector actions
POST {{runtimeUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-1",
  "sessionId": "sess-1",
  "conversationId": "chat-connector-1",
  "query": "List my orders"
}
